{"rule":"lemma-pool/v1","groups":{"obligar":{"host":"c4a22e12","siblings":["60495a70"]}},"rows":{"60495a70":{"word":"obliga","rank":7537,"meanings":[{"headword":"obligar","pos":"VERB","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:obligar:cfd","translation":"to force","context":"to compel"},{"headword":"obligar","pos":"VERB","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:obligar:38d","translation":"to make","context":"to compel"},{"headword":"obligar","pos":"VERB","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:obligar:9b4","translation":"to bind","context":"to compel"},{"headword":"obligar","pos":"VERB","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:obligar:793","translation":"to oblige","context":"to compel"},{"headword":"obligarse","pos":"VERB","source_reference":"spanishdict-menu:obligarse:713","translation":"to commit oneself","context":"to pledge to"}]}},"examples":{"60495a70":{"m":[[{"t":"Siento una oscuridad a mi alrededor que me obliga a hacer cosas.","e":"I feel darkness all around me that compells me to do things.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"6e334b8d5c590dbb3176c155fbfd5885","i":"04ba7a94e8b5269ce0c57e6b09ec06e2","r":"5178716:6647266:3:1563868","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5178716","6647266","3"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Me obliga a permanecer atrás y hacer de niñera.","e":"I'm being forced to stay behind and play nursemaid.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"816f89b11bf6e1f43afd56f9b590ed6b","i":"3fc63e3a4f3a521effc89f9b09f05438","r":"4879062:6588250:192:1195411","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4879062","6588250","192"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Y un lugar así nos obliga a convertirnos en guerreros o víctimas.","e":"And a place like this forces us to become warriors or victims.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"10c0d05abe955d637eaf071e5bb858f9","i":"2e0540de005d3924876760ddf1deb6c6","r":"4633690:7057505:772:3060656","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4633690","7057505","772"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"La vida nos obliga a improvisar de vez en cuando.","e":"Life forces us to improvise from time to time.","s":"tatoeba","x":"cc5446c8ea004a403929a2fa25df494e","i":"b2d2fefab48cbf493224f45691f8b665","r":"13531710:13603926","c":"Seael","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/13531710","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/13531710","b":"Tatoeba sentence #13531710 by Seael; English translation #13603926 by rul","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/13531710","tu":1,"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Te obliga a mirar hacia adentro y examinar el monstruo que realmente eres.","e":"Forces you to look inward and examine the monster you truly are.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"642de2539b62efc38e20c90194e7938a","i":"a700188ca58d9e317d47f8aeb1d808f9","r":"2436682:6710293:852:147469","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["2436682","6710293","852"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Sus hombres no quieren pelear, los obliga.","e":"His men don't want to fight for him. They're forced to fight for him.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"1670702a22174dc886e2b2c341461b1b","i":"154e911eb0ac9a2b1f59aba6b845c735","r":"4283088:6663332:129:597987","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4283088","6663332","129"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"La espada todavía obliga a decir la verdad.","e":"The sword still compels the truth.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"8abe31f8f2236483648c1c83348c9426","i":"1faa602e5f969fada78fe5e0304d5d3f","r":"5616026:7059138:557:3308413","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5616026","7059138","557"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Obliga a la verdad a salir de mí.","e":"Force the truth out of me.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"7fc5b60ebcf91fcd8abd0a1eda2a30de","i":"d42e6e0fd4b453a634930ecac035a074","r":"5822528:6803914:790:2515912","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5822528","6803914","790"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Ninguna ley te obliga a quedarte.","e":"No law says you have to stick around.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"e87f32b22cab172f6d72e726b473fb8c","i":"1dd3ccda25311fc93ab6a92f9b62d